Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:47:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] FileChooser: Quick Look with the space bar

Like macOS: with the focus in the file list, space opens a bigger preview
of the selected file in its own window (fitted to 80 % of the monitor);
space or escape closes it and the arrows move through the files while it
is open. The preview code moves to src/gui/file_preview.rs.

